  "projectName": "Mini-DLSS",
  "projectDescription": "A from-scratch video frame interpolation pipeline inspired by NVIDIA DLSS Frame Generation. Predicts the missing middle frame (B) from two frames (A, C) using Farneback optical flow and occlusion-aware bidirectional warping, then evaluates quality with PSNR/SSIM against ground truth. Phase 1 is a pure Python/OpenCV pipeline; Phase 2 adds CUDA kernels and a C++ desktop GUI application.",
